        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.218,
            0.091,
            0.452,
            0.112
          ],
          "content": "2%巴比妥钠 10ml"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.218,
            0.113,
            0.444,
            0.134
          ],
          "content": "2%氯化钙 2ml"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.218,
            0.134,
            0.445,
            0.155
          ],
          "content": "2%硫酸镁 1ml"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.218,
            0.155,
            0.452,
            0.176
          ],
          "content": "蒸馏水 20ml"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.177,
            0.304,
            0.197
          ],
          "content": "2）2%硝酸钴。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.198,
            0.416,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": "3）1%硫化铵（临用前配）。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.228,
            0.296,
            0.252
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "【方法与步骤】"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.262,
            0.733,
            0.283
          ],
          "content": "（1）新鲜肾组织冰冻切片置 $37^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}$ 碱性磷酸酶作用液 $30\\sim 60\\mathrm{min}$。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.284,
            0.325,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": "(2) 蒸馏水漂洗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.305,
            0.499,
            0.325
          ],
          "content": "(3) 浸入 2% 硝酸钴溶液中 3\\~5min。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.327,
            0.323,
            0.347
          ],
          "content": "（4）蒸馏水漂洗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.348,
            0.499,
            0.368
          ],
          "content": "(5) 浸入 1% 硫化铵溶液中 3\\~5min。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.369,
            0.345,
            0.39
          ],
          "content": "(6) 蒸馏水洗数次。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.39,
            0.405,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": "(7) 晾干，甘油明胶封片。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.411,
            0.264,
            0.431
          ],
          "content": "(8) 镜检。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.433,
            0.71,
            0.453
          ],
          "content": "碱性磷酸酶呈灰黄色、灰黑色到黑色，色深者表示酶的量多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.455,
            0.284,
            0.473
          ],
          "content": "\\- 对照实验:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.476,
            0.906,
            0.52
          ],
          "content": "标本与作用液反应前先用高温（50～80℃）处理30min，使酶失去活性，做好标记，其他步骤相同。对照组的作用液中也可不加β-甘油磷酸钠，而以蒸馏水代替。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.526,
            0.215,
            0.551
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "【作业】"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.561,
            0.508,
            0.582
          ],
          "content": "简述实验的原理，记录分析实验结果。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.814,
            0.606,
            0.903,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": "(戚康标)"
        }
      ]
    }
